thor":"曹义","text":"古人千里重鹅毛，万里将来意更饶。\n惭愧客边无以报，新诗聊写代琼瑶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邵郎中因其纳宠故戏之 其一","author":"曹义","text":"自道精神不似先，好将真汞固丹田。\n如何尚有风流态，忘却糟糠伴少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邵郎中因其纳宠故戏之 其二","author":"曹义","text":"官居仙境列仙班，炼淂丹砂有几般。\n衰朽自惭蒲柳质，肯分㱔子驻容颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口占送吴公琰兼寄宗濂等友 其一","author":"曹义","text":"三年大比又临期，每过西风忆旧知。\n送别官亭寄消息，秋香须折两三枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口占送吴公琰兼寄宗濂等友 其二","author":"曹义","text":"光阴冉冉急如流，回首槐黄又是秋。\n折得秋香听捷日，都门翘首候行舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张先生致仕归闽 其一","author":"曹义","text":"昭代王门久曳裾，承恩今喜赋归欤。\n平生心地清如水，行李萧萧总是书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张先生致仕归闽 其二","author":"曹义","text":"颜如丹渥发如霜，廿载相逢在帝乡。\n此日一樽临祖道，交情浑似别情长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张先生致仕归闽 其三","author":"曹义","text":"兰舟晓发潞河坝，思入平沙路几千。\n想淂到家寻旧业，白云书屋尚依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张先生致仕归闽 其四","author":"曹义","text":"春暖莺花满禁城，惜春那忍送人行。\n柳边怕听呢喃燕，似向东风诉别情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄中书洪益中梦菊先生四首 其一","author":"曹义","text":"我来君去不相逢，廿载交情若梦中。\n遥想书囱吟乐处，春风醉看落花红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄中书洪益中梦菊先生四首 其二","author":"曹义","text":"都门风月昔同游，归老家山几阅秋。\n清思也知多梦菊，不知曾梦故人不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄中书洪益中梦菊先生四首 其三","author":"曹义","text":"望入天台客路长，江云野树思茫茫。\n别来每叹光阴速，屈指于今巳十霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄中书洪益中梦菊先生四首 其四","author":"曹义","text":"樗材惭愧职南曹，闇劣何由识俊髦。\n独念故人成久别，多情聊尔寄霜毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题三益图","author":"曹义","text":"大夫自是栋梁材，惯历冰霜老不摧。\n若问平生谁是伴，湘娥姑射共徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为李进士题竹","author":"曹义","text":"湘江梦断路漫漫，露叶烟梢画里看。\n忆昔短蓬孤泊夜，鹧鸪啼彻雨声寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄嘉兴黄子勉太守","author":"曹义","text":"南曹昼永静无尘，坐对红葵忆故人。\n遥想琼林同醉日，门墙桃李几番春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送时阴阳大正归仪真 其一","author":"曹义","text":"慇勤千里寄香芹，珍重斯文气味新。\n愧我平生心性癖，独于此味最相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32666,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送时阴阳大正归仪真 其二","author":"曹义","text":"青囊妙术得家传，簪绂蝉联几百年。\n此日考成膺□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32667,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居效陶体四首 其一","author":"曹义","text":"幽幽村居，异彼廛庐。\n门无车马，户满桑榆。\n羹藜饭糗，淡泊自如。\n时鼓我琴，时读我书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32668,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居效陶体四首 其二","author":"曹义","text":"村居幽幽，面山临流。\n四时代谢，春而复秋。\n载耕载耨，于田于畴。\n租税惟收，此外何求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居效陶体四首 其三","author":"曹义","text":"依依杨柳，荫我户牖。\n柔条嫩叶，念汝宁久。\n嗟彼松篁，四时相守。\n不凋不瘁，为我之友。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居效陶体四首 其四","author":"曹义","text":"嗟予小子，才无寸长。\n寤寐周孔，坠绪茫茫。\n譬彼沧海，欲涉无梁。\n何以自释，尽我壶觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏书严译小扇","author":"曹义","text":"数点山凝晚翠，几家门掩秋晴。\n断续林间鸟韵，吾伊树底书声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水","author":"曹义","text":"雨过溪桥路滑，云深茆屋人闲。\n门掩半林黄叶，窗涵几点青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水图为赵辅作本学教谕克通之子也","author":"曹义","text":"曲曲溪回洲渚，重重树掩人家。\n落日数声啼鸟，春风几度山花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巫山高","author":"徐庸","text":"巫山高哉十二峰，朵朵削出金芙蓉。\n襄王当时梦神女，朝行云兮暮行雨。\n词臣赋后今几年，是耶非耶山依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上之回","author":"徐庸","text":"上之回，巡尧封。\n万灵随，群官从。\n霓旌舞双凤，銮驾纡六龙。\n祥风卫先后，瑞日开曈昽。\n愿效华嵩祝，千龄居九重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将进酒","author":"徐庸","text":"将进酒，意气豪。\n割麟脯，烹羊羔。\n玉壶金?春滟滟，凤笙龙管声嘈嘈。\n牙筹日执徒自劳，酒星夜照青天高。\n良辰美景能几遭，镜中又看生二毛。\n人间万事如浮泡，不若醉乡深处逃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":32677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]